      "id": 1000945,
      "name": "[Affinity] Full Firepower",
      "desc": "Nicole has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>[Field Expansion]</color>. After launching a Dash Attack or Dodge Counter, your character can <color=#2BAD00>immediately follow up with</color> certain attacks near the end of the Basic Attack combo.\nField Expansion: When Nicole uses her <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color>, or <color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate</color>, the diameter of the energy field generated at the target location is increased by 3m.",
      "desc2": "If fear towards the enemy often stems from a lack of firepower, then Nicole flexing full firepower is what instills fear in them.",
